silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_02_manifest_field_arrows_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 02_manifest_field_arrows #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Manifest Field Arrows' the bare symbol VetRecord anchors to MittensYonedaProfile: The Yoneda profile of Mittens: the family of Hom(-, Mittens) and Hom(Mittens, -) sets describing all typed approaches to and departures from Mittens — a representable functor.." .
